    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 55.71,
     "y": 66.62,
     "text": "01",
     "font": "display",
     "size": 14,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 12.57
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 45,
     "y": 128.2,
     "text": "The start",
     "font": "display",
     "size": 34,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 132.58,
     "tracking": -0.5
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 200.1,
     "text": "A year ago I could not run for a bus. I know that because I tried,",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 312.86
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 215.1,
     "text": "and the driver watched me in his mirror, and drove off. Sam",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 297.57
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 230.1,
     "text": "from run club said I should sign up for the marathon, and I",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 291.66
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 245.1,
     "text": "laughed, and then he made me do it on his phone at the bar",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 291.34
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 260.1,
     "text": "before I could change my mind.",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 156.59
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 282.6,
     "text": "Eighteen weeks of training later, we were standing in a corral in",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 315.97
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 297.6,
     "text": "Grant Park at half past seven in the morning with forty",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 272.34
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 312.6,
     "text": "thousand other people and a man dressed as a banana.",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 268.61
    }
   ],
   "text": {
