   "items": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 59.04,
     "text": "The plan",
     "font": "heading",
     "size": 14,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 58.81
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 74.1,
     "text": "The plan was to go out slowly, stay with Sam until halfway, and",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 311.73
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 89.1,
     "text": "then hold on. Deb, who has run more marathons than I have",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 299.2
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 104.1,
     "text": "had hot dinners, said the plan was fine, that the plan always",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 296.33
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 119.1,
     "text": "goes wrong at mile twenty, that this is normal, and that I should",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 316.87
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 134.1,
     "text": "eat a gummy bear when it does.",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 155.34
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 45,
