   "items": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 56.1,
     "text": "Here is the part nobody tells you. The crowd does half the work.",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 316.59
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 71.1,
     "text": "Every mile there are strangers shouting your name off your bib,",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 315.16
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 86.1,
     "text": "and they mean it, and it is the most extraordinary thing.",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 278.64
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 108.6,
     "text": "And then at mile twenty-two there were people who were not",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 303.03
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 123.6,
     "text": "strangers.",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 50.34
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 156.54,
     "text": "The star sign",
     "font": "heading",
     "size": 14,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 88.73
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 171.6,
     "text": "Ivy and Leo had made a sign the night before. It said nothing.",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 303.46
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 186.6,
     "text": "Leo had argued for GO DAD and Ivy had argued for something",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 306.95
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 201.6,
     "text": "longer, and in the end they compromised on a very large drawn",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 313.02
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 216.6,
     "text": "star, colored in, which they held up together and shook. Mom",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 305.32
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 231.6,
     "text": "was behind them with a thermos. I cried. I am not ashamed of",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 306.94
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 246.6,
     "text": "it.",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 10.93
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 45,
